    "detail": "<div class=\"detailmodule_html\"><div class=\"detail-desc-decorate-richtext\"> <p id=\"tl_1\">【Quantity &amp; Size】 20/12/4&nbsp;Pack silicone cable ties, size: 7.5 x 1 cm.<br />4 Different colors help you quickly distinguish different wires.<br />【Flexible and Adjustable】 Wire tie with four holes, can be adjusted according to different cable lengths. Buckle design is convenient to open and close, easy to wind all kinds of cables.<br />【Durable and Reusable】 These cable ties are made of high quality silicone, soft and elastic, with a certain degree of ductility.<br />【Portable and Convenient】 When in use, cord ties can be tied firmly for easy carry. When not in use, it can be put on the data cable to prevent loss. Just one click to release the earbud or cable immediately.<br />【Multipurpose】 Can be used to manage computer cables, network cables, power cords, etc. No need to worry about messy cables. Suitable for office, home, travel.</p> <p><img style=\"width:1000px\" width=\"1000px\" src=\"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/S2f38f21031a2446bb3080ad08083ef7aw.jpg\" slate-data-type=\"image\" /></p> <p><img style=\"width:1000px\" width=\"1000px\" src=\"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/S5f484e0eee6e4770bdd45f9b58be770ah.jpg\" slate-data-type=\"image\" /></p> <p><img style=\"width:1000px\" width=\"1000px\" src=\"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/S9c8961e8cb2b4ad5857a0dfa641e832ck.jpg\" slate-data-type=\"image\" /></p> <p><img style=\"width:1000px\" width=\"1000px\" src=\"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/Sa3d2bddf71a54bb6aef8ecf0cec222e5m.jpg\" slate-data-type=\"image\" /></p> <p><img style=\"width:1000px\" width=\"1000px\" src=\"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/Sa3d2bddf71a54bb6aef8ecf0cec222e5m.jpg\" slate-data-type=\"image\" /></p> <p><img style=\"width:1000px\" width=\"1000px\" src=\"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/S71058a6d21a24a5397ce62997ec54b1cY.jpg\" slate-data-type=\"image\" /></p> <p><img style